      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Hey, fool! Sadaiya!... I told you to bathe the horse... and you bathe a man instead! Do you know who this man is?... The zamindar’s new secretary!.. Educated!.. Rich! Sorry, Mr. Vingan!.. Hey, Sadaiya!... Wipe Mr. Vingan’s boots clean!... Hmm... wipe them, da... dirty fellow!....",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
    },
